Package: hibiiscus
Title: Modelling framework for hierachical ecological impact analysis
Version: 0.1
Authors@R: 
    c(
    person("Richard", "Cornford", , "cornford@iiasa.ac.at", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9963-3603")),
    person("Martin", "Jung", , "martinjung@zoho.com", role = c("aut"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-7569-1390"))
           )
Maintainer: Richard Cornford <cornford@iiasa.ac.at>
Description: This package uses principles of hierarchical modelling to
    assess the impacts of land use and land-use intensity on ecological
    communities. Data and modelling approach originate from the PREDICTS
    framework and are adapted for use with alternative land-use categories 
    (legends), integration of additional ecological data, modelling with frequentist
    and Bayesian approaches, and extended model evaluation.
